 \\in \\mathbb{Z}[q^{\\pm 1}]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EW interface knot <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\bowtie_K</code></td>\n<td>EW interface-knot definition</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>EW braid in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">B_6</code> with interface <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">I</code></td>\n<td>element of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">H_6(q)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Higgs-vev mechanism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Lk}_R^{(1)}</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"#conj:categorical-higgs-mechanism\" data-at=\"mass-theory/mutant-jones-bloch-group\">Categorical Higgs mechanism: Goldstone-eating as topological linking</a>, Step C</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>linking <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k = 1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{End}_R(A)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Categorical linking <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Lk}_R^{(k)}</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"#conj:categorical-linking-operation\">Categorical linking operation <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Lk}_R</code></a></td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>linking integer <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{End}_R(A)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-shuffle convolution <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">*_q</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"#def:frobenius-hopf-substrate\" data-at=\"quantum-observable-universes/algebraic-substrate-reeb\">The quantum vacuum as a Frobenius--Hopf algebra</a></td>\n<td>preserves <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n</code></td>\n<td>preserves <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">K</code> (or merges)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{H}_q^{(n_1 + n_2, K \\cdot K')}</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Volume functor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Vol}</code></td>\n<td><a href=\"#prop:vol-through-tau\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Vol}(K)</code> factors strictly through the fibre functor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau</code></a></td>\n<td><strong>2</strong></td>\n<td>hyperbolic knot</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{P}_2 / \\mathcal{P}_1</code> (real)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chern–Simons <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{CS}</code></td>\n<td>(open in paper)</td>\n<td><strong>3</strong></td>\n<td>hyperbolic knot</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{P}_3 / \\mathcal{P}_2</code> (Tate-twisted)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Trilog at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_5</code> orbit</td>\n<td><a href=\"#conj:bring-trilog-depth-3-witness\">Bring trilog at <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_5</code> as depth-3 grouplike value (50-digit functional-equation cross-validated witness)</a></td>\n<td><strong>3</strong></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">S_5</code>-Bring orbit</td>\n<td>weight-3 cyclotomic period</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/knot-indexed-convolution-grid-table1-data.md","heading":"Table","page":"b/tbl-knot-indexed-convolution-grid-table1-data","qa":{"counts":{"pass":31,"fail":0,"warn":0,"na":27,"unknown":0,"stale":57}}}
